 9492\n\n5:00PM Reception\, 5:30PM Program\nBefore the spotlight turns to t
 he annual Earthshot Innovation Challenge Award Ceremony at the John F. Ken
 nedy Presidential Library this winter\, The 'Quin Impact Fund invites memb
 ers to an exclusive first look at the next generation of climate innovatio
 n.\n\nDuring this special preview\, Earthshot Innovation Challenge semi-fi
 nalists will present their breakthrough concepts\, sharing bold ideas desi
 gned to address some of the world's most pressing environmental challenges
 . Members will hear each pitch\, engage with the ideas\, and cast their vo
 tes in real time to select the solution they wish to propel into the chall
 enge finals\, securing at least $25\,000 in grant funding\, and raising th
 eir chances to be awarded the top prize of $100\,000.\n\nThis exclusive ev
 ent offers a unique opportunity to experience the innovation process first
 hand while helping elevate promising solutions before they take the stage 
 at the formal competition. Be among the first to discover the visionary en
 trepreneurs shaping a more sustainable future - and play a role in recogni
 zing the ideas with the greatest potential to create lasting impact.\n\n*T
 his event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary l
 ight bites and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancel
 lations be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
